<title>POLAND: FORTE AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>FORTE AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.15 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.15 vs   1.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.22 vs   1.24</p>
<p> Sales		   24.31 vs  15.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.66 vs   2.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.68 vs   2.58</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.84 vs  10.23</p>
<p> Sales		  165.37 vs 135.71</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Fabryka Mebli</p>
<p>Forte SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
